<div class="Story">
    <div class="Story-section">
        <h4 class="Story-title">One error, on a visible field</h4>
        <p class="Story-label">
            Nothing is drawn: the message already reads under the field. The host still renders,
            since it is what moves the focus — hence an empty frame below.
        </p>
        <div class="Story-stage Story-stage--narrow">
            <twig:Molecules:FormErrors:Base :sampleEntries="[
                {label: 'Email address', messages: ['This value is not a valid email address.'], target: 'story-email', hidden: false}
            ]" />
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="Story-section">
        <h4 class="Story-title">Three errors, one of them on a field with no place to show it</h4>
        <p class="Story-label">
            Each label links to its field. The third has neither: a hidden field cannot be
            reached, so the summary is the only place its message is read. The links lead nowhere
            here, naming fields of a form this page has not.
        </p>
        <div class="Story-stage Story-stage--narrow">
            <twig:Molecules:FormErrors:Base :sampleEntries="[
                {label: 'Email address', messages: ['This value should not be blank.'], target: 'story-email', hidden: false},
                {label: 'Password', messages: ['This value should not be blank.'], target: 'story-password', hidden: false},
                {label: null, messages: ['The captcha is invalid.'], target: null, hidden: true}
            ]" />
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="Story-section">
        <h4 class="Story-title">Two fields, one of them holding two messages</h4>
        <p class="Story-label">
            One entry per field, not per message: a field that broke two rules keeps one line and
            one link, and reads both. The count counts fields to go back to.
        </p>
        <div class="Story-stage Story-stage--narrow">
            <twig:Molecules:FormErrors:Base :sampleEntries="[
                {label: 'City', messages: ['This value should not be blank.', 'Your city can only contains letters.'], target: 'story-city', hidden: false},
                {label: 'Zip code', messages: ['This value should not be blank.'], target: 'story-zipcode', hidden: false}
            ]" />
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="Story-section">
        <h4 class="Story-title">One error, on a field with no place to show it</h4>
        <p class="Story-label">
            A single error still gets a summary here, for want of anywhere else to appear.
        </p>
        <div class="Story-stage Story-stage--narrow">
            <twig:Molecules:FormErrors:Base :sampleEntries="[
                {label: null, messages: ['The captcha is invalid.'], target: null, hidden: true}
            ]" />
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
